OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4  G2/2
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer fears onion shortage unless
OL,4,Aretailers adapt
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If this [weather] is going to
OL,7,Fcontinue, I think our food security is
OL,8,Fgoing to be a very, very important
OL,9,Fissue," Long said. The British Retail
OL,10,FConsortium said retailers were
OL,11,F"experienced in managing supply
OL,12,Fdisruptions".
